    "# SQ2 — Dynamic Fire Environment How does a dynamically spreading fire affect the performance gap between GA and greedy?\n",
    "Why: Makes the simulation more realistic. Fire punishes agents who are congested at the wrong place at the wrong time — directly amplifying greedy's weakness at bottlenecks.\n"
